; Ends through the BIOS trap handler with exit code 3, so the BIOS reaches its
; `halt`: the one path the doubler never takes. The handler sits at mtvec,
; which the BIOS sets to 0x107c (4220), and treats r17 = 93 as the exit syscall with
; the code in r10. Both emulators must report the run as failed, with code 3.
main:
	copyb(0, 93) -> r17
	copyb(0, 3) -> r10
	jump(0x107c)
